"Used to derive compaction and rolling-window limits. A 1M-token model can use 1000000; a local 8k model should use 8000 and a lower max_tokens. 0 disables automatic context management." = "用于推导压缩与滚动窗口限制。1M token 模型可填 1000000；本地 8k 模型应填 8000，并降低 max_tokens。0 关闭自动上下文管理。";
