"Blank uses the base Leader model. Prices are USD per 1M tokens and are only used when a USD session budget is set. Per-role context window overrides the global value; blank uses the global model window." = "留空使用基础 Leader 模型。价格为每 1M token 的美元单价，仅在设置 USD 会话预算时使用。按角色上下文窗口覆盖全局值；留空使用全局模型窗口。";
"Per-session hard caps. Defaults are 4 Managers / 6 Workers / 12 Labour; runtime limits are 5 / 10 / 40. Applying also re-saves the current provider configuration." = "每会话硬上限。默认 4 经理 / 6 执行者 / 12 协作员；运行时上限 5 / 10 / 40。应用时也会重新保存当前模型服务配置。";
"When a plan has more ready tasks than the base Worker cap, expand Workers up to the hard cap of 10 while at least 20% of the session token budget remains. Off by default." = "当计划中的就绪任务超过基础 Worker 上限时，在会话 token 预算至少剩余 20% 的情况下，将 Worker 扩展到硬上限 10。默认关闭。";
"Capacity is unavailable until the daemon is connected." = "daemon 连接后才会显示容量。";
"Daemon-wide Worker/Labour admission. Per-session caps still apply. Set VERLINPARK_GLOBAL_WORKERS and VERLINPARK_GLOBAL_LABOUR on the daemon to change the limits." = "daemon 全局 Worker/Labour 准入。每会话上限仍然生效。可在 daemon 上设置 VERLINPARK_GLOBAL_WORKERS 和 VERLINPARK_GLOBAL_LABOUR 修改上限。";
